Hi guys,

long time without posting on the list, and now I'm sending this Off
Topic... shame !

Anyway... I wanted to let you all know that we have presented AlterMundi
networks for the FRIDA Awards 2015. It's a prize organized by LACNIC,
the Latin American RIR.

There is one prize slot open for public election and we are doing so
well on that front that we are aiming for it.

We are head to head with another project and today is the last day for
online voting, so you are all invited to stop by

http://programafrida.net/projects/projects/view/869

...and cast your vote. It just takes a few seconds!

The project is written in Spanish but there's enough info in English
about our work in cas you are not familiar with it.

@marek: we are finally creating the inter-town network (6 towns
actually), to deploy our batman+bmx6 design (Libre-Mesh). We'll have
news on this during the next few months.

If you wish to share this with other people, there's a 2min. video that
you can use to that end:

http://youtu.be/4SgVq7e40P4


Thanks for reading and for the support!

Cheers,
Nico



